1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,664
My living room wall just whispered tonight's exact grocery list before I even thought of it.

2
00:00:05,964 --> 00:00:12,564
I pressed my ear against the cold plaster, hearing the faint murmur of my own voice talking back.

3
00:00:12,864 --> 00:00:20,712
It recited every broken promise I made today, spoken by a mouth I cannot see hiding behind the drywall.

4
00:00:21,012 --> 00:00:27,732
The rent is cheap because the previous tenant never left. They are just buried deep inside the mortar.

5
00:00:28,032 --> 00:00:35,520
Then the wall stopped echoing the past. It started narrating a horrifying argument I am about to have.

6
00:00:35,820 --> 00:00:42,492
A stranger steps through my front door in the audio, shouting demands I refuse to ever accept.

7
00:00:42,792 --> 00:00:50,544
The plaster crackles loudly, spitting out the sound of shattering glass and a desperate plea for mercy.

8
00:00:50,844 --> 00:00:58,188
I grabbed a heavy iron poker to defend myself against the unseen ghost trapped inside my home.

9
00:00:58,488 --> 00:01:05,040
The wall gasped its final warning: 'Stop swinging the iron, you idiot, you are killing me!'

10
00:01:05,340 --> 00:01:10,356
If the wall just spoke my dying breath, whose hand is holding the knife right now?
